</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'>
    <b>
        <span style='font-size:11.0pt;
color:black'>11.<u>VARIATION IN THE ACTUAL AREA OF THE ALLOTTED PLOT</u></span>
    </b>
</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'>
    <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>&nbsp;</span>
</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify'>
    <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
        The area of the plot allotted or handed
        over may vary from the size of the plot allotted/applied for. If area of the
        plot mentioned in allotment letter and actual area handed over to the
        allottee/lessee is found to be different than the area intimated in the actual
        site plan, a proportionate change in the amount of the premium would be made.
        No communication in this regard shall be entertained by the lessor on the
        ground of variation in the size of plot. Allottee/lessee would also have no
        right to apply for change of plot or refund of money deposited by him against this
        account, incase of variation in area of allotted plot is under 10%. In case of
