        the specific industry is obtained in writing from the NOIDA Authority.
    </span>
</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:37.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-.25in'>
    <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
        b<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
        </span>
    </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
        Unit would comply with
        all the state/ central Govt. Statutory requirement, as applicable to permitted
        unit.
    </span>
</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:37.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-.25in'>
    <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
        c<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
        </span>
    </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
        The unit would obtain
        the NOC consent from the UP Pollution Control Board. The main plant of the unit
        would only function when the mandatory pollution control plant and equipment’s
        are totally fully in operation.
    </span>
</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:37.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-.25in'>
    <span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
        d<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>
            &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
        </span>
    </span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black'>
