        activity in the unit, which is cause/source of nuisance to the neighbours
        and/or general public and or is detrimental/prejudice to public
        interests/environment.
    </span>
</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:37.55pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-.25in'>
